{"author":[{"collection_id":"Authors","document_content":{"avatar":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_50ac3cbb26fa4c21a9967e26675f94c5_/e542d55e05d06e63bbf3dadd467d6f4889a15a6c2c43b46c812a48b6ee2adf7ff126e17cb0d3c04d4d2f24d216f00138ed4cd9cbf209538cb1bd0f4fd7ac7f15","height":2000,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/ECgal03qq-GPHfoWRZft82d97qPwwB-M4z1d-igDCWWAMWhJteOVP4HzaU2XhhQVfG9ME-_0DWTFA1eK28kgnTgTHBpSnTIhLK8TQKwE0zyq_lFckrs","width":2000},"name":"James Williams","title":"Material Developer Advocate"},"document_id":5856972825690112,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"}],"body_content":[{"code_snippet":["```java\n@ColorInt\npublic static int harmonizeWithPrimary(@NonNull Context context, @ColorInt int colorToHarmonize) {  }\n\n\n@ColorInt\npublic static int harmonize(@ColorInt int colorToHarmonize, @ColorInt int colorToHarmonizeWith) {  }\n```","```java\nval dynamicColorsContext = DynamicColors.wrapContextIfAvailable(requireContext())\n\nval harmonizedOptions = HarmonizedColorsOptions.Builder()\n .setColorResourceIds(intArrayOf(R.color.custom1, R.color.custom2))\n .build();\n\nharmonizedContext =\n HarmonizedColors.wrapContextIfAvailable(dynamicColorsContext, harmonizedOptions)\n```"],"content":"<p>从 Google I/O 的热度中冷却下来之后，我们有一对 Material Design Components（MDC）发布要与你分享：<a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/releases/tag/1.6.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">1.6.0</a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/releases/tag/1.6.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">1.6.1</a>。与 MDC 1.5.0 一样，颜色再次成为主要主题，带来了针对<a href=\"https://m3.material.io/styles/color/dynamic-color/overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">动态颜色（dynamic color）</a>和<a href=\"https://material.io/blog/dynamic-color-harmony\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">颜色协调（color harmony）</a>的新 API。</p>\n<p>其他亮点包括多个组件的 Material3 样式更新和各项 bug 修复，比如解决了 Android Oreo（8）和 Pie（9）上的问题，彰显了我们不止关注最新版本的承诺。</p>\n<p>除了托管在 <a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/tree/master/docs\">Github</a> 上的文档，<a href=\"https://m3.material.io/\">Material Design 3 网站</a>也是获取样式指导和组件可用性信息的另一来源。对于 MDC Views 上可用的组件，实现页面会包含代码片段，向你展示如何实现该组件以及常见用例。下面是<a href=\"https://m3.material.io/components/chips/implementation\">信息条（Chip）的实现页面</a>上可以找到的部分代码。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=0&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=1&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<h2>颜色协调</h2>\n<p>在宣布 MDC 1.5.0 的<a href=\"https://material.io/blog/android-stable-release-1-5\">博客文章</a>中，我们讨论了如何借助工具选择每个 Material3 主题核心颜色之外的颜色。动态主题中的自定义或扩展颜色引出一个有趣的问题：&ldquo;我们如何保证一个保留的颜色在动态主题旁边看起来协调，并且依然清晰可读？&rdquo;</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=2&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p>我们用来创建 Material3 主题的算法可以通过一个叫做颜色协调（color harmony）的概念来处理这种情况。这种协调通过将目标颜色向源颜色偏移来实现。彼此更接近的颜色看起来更和谐，而相距更远的颜色看起来更不协调。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=3&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=4&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p>想进一步了解颜色科学以及颜色协调的缘由和方法，请阅读 <a href=\"https://material.io/blog/science-of-color-design\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">色彩与设计的科学（The Science of Color &amp; Design）</a>和 <a href=\"https://material.io/blog/dynamic-color-harmony\">将协调设计融入动态颜色（Designing Harmony into Dynamic Color）</a>。</p>\n<h3>按需应用颜色协调</h3>\n<p>使用 <a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/blob/948d5dac03a55971338d36bb52f1f49bd448ebd7/lib/java/com/google/android/material/color/MaterialColors.java#L185\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><code>harmonizeWithPrimary</code></a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/blob/948d5dac03a55971338d36bb52f1f49bd448ebd7/lib/java/com/google/android/material/color/MaterialColors.java#L199\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><code>harmonize</code></a> 函数，你可以将给定颜色与主题的主色或任意颜色进行协调。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-code-snippet index=0&gt;&lt;/mio-code-snippet&gt;</p>\n<h3>系统化地应用颜色协调</h3>\n<p>在大多数情况下，你不会想按需计算协调后的颜色，而是希望利用 MDC 1.6.0 中的辅助类，它们可以接收一组属性或颜色，并无缝地为你的主题返回协调后的版本。HarmonizedColorAttributes 和 HarmonizedColorOptions 是两个构建器类，可让你在获取动态颜色 Context 时启用协调。</p>\n<p>下面的代码片段展示了如何构建一个自动与两个指定颜色协调的动态 Context。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-code-snippet index=1&gt;&lt;/mio-code-snippet&gt;</p>\n<p>想要更详细地了解如何在代码中应用颜色协调，请查看我们颜色开发者文档中的<a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/blob/master/docs/theming/Color.md#using-color-harmonization\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">颜色协调（Color Harmonization）部分</a>，或演示了这两种方法的<a href=\"https://codelabs.developers.google.com/harmonize-color-android-views#2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Codelab</a>。</p>\n<h2>MDC 的下一步？</h2>\n<p>我们正全力开发 MDC 的下一个主要版本。你可以在 GitHub 上关注进展、提交<a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/issues/new?assignees=&amp;labels=bug&amp;template=bug_report.md&amp;title=%5BComponent+name%5D+Short+description+of+issue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">bug 报告</a>和<a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/issues/new?assignees=&amp;labels=feature+request&amp;template=feature_request.md&amp;title=%5BComponent+name%5D+Short+description+of+request\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">功能请求</a>。也欢迎在 Twitter 上联系我们 <a href=\"https://twitter.com/materialdesign\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">@materialdesign</a>。</p>","image":[{"a11y_description":"Screenshot from material.io","bordered":true,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/40c162fcca1d73b584de9bf0eb81d9c51de2763cde2eab5e4811daf42cf66ae075e2b171c4ba6c31a01f7c7c38059d97ad6e3d26fbdad833ce5e7db57706e702","height":468,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/vGK0OPM_NKfC3c5wny9p5kkdUYysXlK8uWsXPpmcXZz0i6Ntq0H4Lnsc5Po6RhkMsTR4QjQQ0UljDNa5WWdeinnSUeuWlWkfmrsYm1GyYbo4D4sJBls","width":1242}},{"a11y_description":"Screenshot from material.io","bordered":true,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/11efbfd65d3